<article
  class="card card-border overflow-hidden bg-base-200 text-base-content shadow-sm"
  data-role-fit
>
  <div class="grid gap-0 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <section class="p-6 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="role-fit-target">
      <h3
        id="role-fit-target"
        class="font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-tight"
      >
        Where I fit
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-base-content/75">
        I am looking for full-stack or backend-oriented work. Internal tools,
        web platforms, application modernization, and migration projects are a
        particularly good match for my experience.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section
      class="border-t border-base-300 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0"
      aria-labelledby="role-fit-evidence"
    >
      <h3
        id="role-fit-evidence"
        class="font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-tight"
      >
        What I bring
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-base-content/75">
        I have worked with enterprise Java, Python migration tools, web
        platforms, and production reliability issues. My personal projects add
        FastAPI, REST APIs, authentication, and data persistence.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section
      class="border-t border-base-300 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0"
      aria-labelledby="role-fit-growth"
    >
      <h3
        id="role-fit-growth"
        class="font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-tight"
      >
        Where I want to grow
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-base-content/75">
        I want more responsibility for the services and data behind a product. I
        also want to deepen my cloud and backend framework experience.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>
